- productKind → stateAt productKind field (the swap's product identity) · pipStyle → pip rendering branch data (dieData faces + PIP_LAYOUT selection) · dieBasePx → die sizes, stack cell, stackPos · dieRadiusPx → die rect rx · pipRadiusFrac → pip radius · pipOffsetFrac → pip positions · stackColGapPx/stackRowGapPx → stack cell pitch · stackLayerDyFrac/stackRowPitchFrac → stackPos y · scatterYFrac/pileCenterDyPx → pile positions in stateAt.
